<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>字符串 - 标签 - 豆浆小屋</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/tags/%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2/</link><description>字符串 - 标签 - 豆浆小屋</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/tags/%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>字典树（Trie）</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/snippets/trie/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>作者</name></author><guid>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/snippets/trie/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>字典树（Trie）是一种树形数据结构，用于高效地存储和检索字符串数据集。</p>
<h2 id="基本结构" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84" class="header-mark"></a>1 基本结构</h2><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">struct</span> <span class="nc">TrieNode</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="n">isEnd</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">:</span> <span class="n">isEnd</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">26</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="k">nullptr</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">};</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h2 id="常用操作" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c" class="header-mark"></a>2 常用操作</h2><h3 id="插入单词" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%8f%92%e5%85%a5%e5%8d%95%e8%af%8d" class="header-mark"></a>2.1 插入单词</h3><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">void</span> <span class="nf">insert</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">root</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="nl">c</span> <span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="o">!</span><span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="k">new</span> <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="p">();</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">isEnd</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="搜索单词" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%90%9c%e7%b4%a2%e5%8d%95%e8%af%8d" class="header-mark"></a>2.2 搜索单词</h3><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="nf">search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">root</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="nl">c</span> <span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="o">!</span><span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">isEnd</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="前缀匹配" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%89%8d%e7%bc%80%e5%8c%b9%e9%85%8d" class="header-mark"></a>2.3 前缀匹配</h3><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="nf">startsWith</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">prefix</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">TrieNode</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">root</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">char</span> <span class="nl">c</span> <span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">prefix</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="o">!</span><span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">node</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">node</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">children</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">c</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">&#39;a&#39;</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h2 id="应用场景" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%ba%94%e7%94%a8%e5%9c%ba%e6%99%af" class="header-mark"></a>3 应用场景</h2><ul>
<li>自动补全</li>
<li>拼写检查</li>
<li>IP路由表</li>
<li>词频统计</li>
</ul>
]]></description></item><item><title>C 字符串与内存操作函数速查</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/c%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>作者</name></author><guid>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/c%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="字符串内存操作函数速查" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6%e4%b8%b2%e5%86%85%e5%ad%98%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0%e9%80%9f%e6%9f%a5" class="header-mark"></a>1 字符串/内存操作函数速查</h2><table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>函数</th>
          <th>参数说明</th>
          <th>作用</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td><code>strlen(str)</code></td>
          <td><code>str</code> — 目标字符串</td>
          <td>计算字符串长度，不包含 <code>'\0'</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>memmove(dst, src, n)</code></td>
          <td><code>dst</code> — 目标地址（destination）<br><code>src</code> — 源地址（source）<br><code>n</code> — 要移动的字节数</td>
          <td>移动 <code>n</code> 字节，<strong>允许内存区域重叠</strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>memcpy(dst, src, n)</code></td>
          <td><code>dst</code> — 目标地址（destination）<br><code>src</code> — 源地址（source）<br><code>n</code> — 要复制的字节数</td>
          <td>复制 <code>n</code> 字节，<strong>不允许内存区域重叠</strong>（重叠时行为未定义）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>memset(dst, value, n)</code></td>
          <td><code>dst</code> — 目标地址（destination）<br><code>value</code> — 要填充的值（转为 unsigned char）<br><code>n</code> — 要填充的字节数</td>
          <td>将一段内存的每个字节填充为指定值</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>strcpy(dst, src)</code></td>
          <td><code>dst</code> — 目标缓冲区（destination）<br><code>src</code> — 源字符串（source）</td>
          <td>复制 C 风格字符串，包括结尾的 <code>'\0'</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>strcmp(a, b)</code></td>
          <td><code>a</code> — 字符串 A<br><code>b</code> — 字符串 B</td>
          <td>比较两个 C 风格字符串，相等返回 0</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>strchr(str, ch)</code></td>
          <td><code>str</code> — 被搜索的字符串<br><code>ch</code> — 要查找的字符</td>
          <td>在字符串中查找字符，返回首次出现的位置指针</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>strstr(str, sub)</code></td>
          <td><code>str</code> — 被搜索的字符串（haystack）<br><code>sub</code> — 要查找的子串（needle）</td>
          <td>在字符串中查找子串，返回首次出现的位置指针</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong> <code>memmove</code> 和 <code>memcpy</code> 的区别——当 <code>src</code> 和 <code>dst</code> 的内存区域有重叠时，必须用 <code>memmove</code>，因为它会先拷贝到临时缓冲区再写入，保证正确性；<code>memcpy</code> 不处理重叠情况，可能导致数据损坏。</p></blockquote>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>函数名</th>
          <th>全称拆分</th>
          <th>英文原意</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>strlen</strong></td>
          <td>str = string；len = length</td>
          <td><strong>string length</strong> 字符串长度</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>memmove</strong></td>
          <td>mem = memory；move</td>
          <td><strong>memory move</strong> 内存移动</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>memcpy</strong></td>
          <td>mem = memory；cpy = copy</td>
          <td><strong>memory copy</strong> 内存复制</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>memset</strong></td>
          <td>mem = memory；set</td>
          <td><strong>memory set</strong> 内存填充</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>strcpy</strong></td>
          <td>str = string；cpy = copy</td>
          <td><strong>string copy</strong> 字符串复制</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>strcmp</strong></td>
          <td>str = string；cmp = compare</td>
          <td><strong>string compare</strong> 字符串比较</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>strchr</strong></td>
          <td>str = string；chr = character</td>
          <td><strong>string character</strong> 在字符串查找字符</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><strong>strstr</strong></td>
          <td>str = string；第二个 str = substring</td>
          <td><strong>string substring</strong> 在字符串查找子串</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="补充规律方便记忆" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e8%a1%a5%e5%85%85%e8%a7%84%e5%be%8b%e6%96%b9%e4%be%bf%e8%ae%b0%e5%bf%86" class="header-mark"></a>2 补充规律（方便记忆）</h2><ol>
<li><strong><code>str</code> 开头 → 只处理「C 风格字符串」</strong>，依赖 <code>\0</code> 结束标记；</li>
<li><strong><code>mem</code> 开头 → 纯粹操作内存块</strong>，不识别字符串结束符，按字节数量处理；</li>
<li>通用缩写约定：
<ul>
<li><code>cpy</code> = copy</li>
<li><code>cmp</code> = compare</li>
<li><code>chr</code> = character</li>
<li><code>len</code> = length</li>
<li><code>sub</code> = substring</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
]]></description></item></channel></rss>